[
  {
    "id": "ntp_smoke_01",
    "proto": "ntp",
    "summary": "[chain] 冒烟：NTPv4 client 请求（空配置）。顶层不设端口 → 默认 dst 123（IANA），VN=4/Mode=3/Stratum=0，共 1 包",
    "spec_json": {
      "layers": [
        {
          "udp": {}
        },
        {
          "ntp": {}
        }
      ],
      "ntp": {}
    },
    "expect": {
      "packet_count": 1,
      "fields": [
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "udp.dstport",
          "value": "123"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "ntp.flags.vn",
          "value": "4"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "ntp.flags.mode",
          "value": "3"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "ntp.flags.li",
          "value": "0"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "ntp.stratum",
          "value": "0"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "ntp.ppoll",
          "value": "6"
        },
        {
          "packet": 1,
          "field": "ntp.xmt",
          "nonzero": true
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        "RFC 5905 §7.3：LI/VN/Mode 首字节、Stratum、Poll 为固定头字段；client 请求 Mode=3、VN=4",
        "顶层未设端口：dst 默认 123（strategy_convert）、src 保持 flow 默认 12345，不断言；随机传输时间戳（ntp.xmt 动态）不断言具体值",
        "ntp.xmt nonzero：请求必须携带当前时间戳（探针实测非零）；refid/rootdelay/org 空配置恒 0（客户端未同步，探针实测）故不断言",
        "tshark 探针实测：vn=4、mode=3、li=0、stratum=0、ppoll=6、dstport=123",
        "layers chain style: [udp,ntp]"
      ]
    }
  }
]
